          "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n1. The applicants should be a permanent resident of Meghalaya.\n1. The applicant should be a bonafide farmer engaged in agriculture.\n1. The applicant/farmer should own or lease land of at least 0.2 hectares or more.\n\n"
